{
  "instruction": "A professional 3x1 vertical panel grid in a single 16:9 4K masterpiece showcasing the exact same young East Asian female model from the reference image, full body head-to-toe in every panel, wearing a blue cyber asymmetrical chic one-piece swimsuit with no shoes. Futuristic editorial beauty aesthetic with absolute fidelity to her glossy straight black hair, electric-blue front panels, center part, numerous silver metal hair clips, icy blue cyber makeup, dramatic black spiked lashes, rhinestone accents, fair luminous skin, soft nude lips, and poised neutral expression. Uniform solid Absolute White background #FFFFFF. No text, labels, captions, logos, borders, or dividing lines inside the image.",
